<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1889988412"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1592086388"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="雨ほうし"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="平葵"/><amll:meta key="album" value="雨ほうし"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:53.862"><div begin="00:10.772" end="03:53.862"><p begin="00:10.772" end="00:13.704" itunes:key="L1">遠くで聞こえる天気予報<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远远响起天气预报的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku de ki ko e ru te n ki yo ho u</span></p><p begin="00:13.705" end="00:16.459" itunes:key="L2">遡上す思い出 まだ夢模様<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回忆涌上心头 正如梦境那般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so jo u su o mo i de ma da yu me mo yo u</span></p><p begin="00:16.460" end="00:18.835" itunes:key="L3">重い目 朝日通して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼皮沉重 透过晨曦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i me a sa hi to o shi te</span></p><p begin="00:18.836" end="00:22.067" itunes:key="L4">醒めて苦悩 スロウの右脳<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唤醒了烦恼 与迟钝的右脑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa me te ku no u su ro u no u no u</span></p><p begin="00:22.068" end="00:24.586" itunes:key="L5">血と混ざったミント風味<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">糅混在血液里的薄荷滋味</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi to ma za 't ta mi n to fu u mi</span></p><p begin="00:24.587" end="00:27.239" itunes:key="L6">ドロップのハズレと夏の日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失落随夏日到来滴落在心扉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ro 'p pu no ha zu re to na tsu no hi</span></p><p begin="00:27.240" end="00:29.732" itunes:key="L7">大丈夫の残り火<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待无关紧要的余烬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i jo u bu no no ko ri bi</span></p><p begin="00:29.733" end="00:32.566" itunes:key="L8">水で消してもう大人に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用水熄灭后就能长大成人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi zu de ke shi te mo u o to na ni</span></p><p begin="00:32.567" end="00:35.472" itunes:key="L9">雨はやり 絶え間なし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">落雨仍旧 绵绵不绝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me ha ya ri ta e ma na shi</span></p><p begin="00:35.473" end="00:38.285" itunes:key="L10">晴れ近し ならえよし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">晴空将至 遵循自然</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha re chi ka shi na ra e yo shi</span></p><p begin="00:38.286" end="00:40.887" itunes:key="L11">バカしい昔話 がしかし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是那段尽显愚蠢的往事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba ka shi i mu ka shi ba na shi ga shi ka shi</span></p><p begin="00:40.888" end="00:43.684" itunes:key="L12">可視化した 曖昧な今<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在暧昧的此刻愈发清晰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka shi ka shi ta a i ma i na i ma</span></p><p begin="00:43.685" end="00:46.487" itunes:key="L13">ローファーが鳴き 懐古シンパシー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏响的平底鞋 引发怀旧的共鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ro o fa a ga na ki ka i ko shi n pa shi i</span></p><p begin="00:46.488" end="00:49.041" itunes:key="L14">一途に まるでアイロニー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心无旁骛 就像是一种讽刺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi zu ni ma ru de a i ro ni i</span></p><p begin="00:49.042" end="00:51.194" itunes:key="L15">スカートを絞って待った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">揪紧了裙摆翘首以待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ka a to wo shi bo 't te ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:51.195" end="00:54.053" itunes:key="L16">まだ スタートも切ってないや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们此刻还未迎来开始之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da su ta a to mo ki 't te na i ya</span></p><p begin="00:54.054" end="00:55.332" itunes:key="L17">フラッシュバック<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回忆闪现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ra 's shu ba 'k ku</span></p><p begin="00:55.333" end="00:57.492" itunes:key="L18">また死んで輪廻転生<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次历经生死轮回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta shi n de ri n ne te n se i</span></p><p begin="00:57.493" end="01:00.123" itunes:key="L19">繰り返してすり減らした生命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日复一日消磨着生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e shi te su ri he ra shi ta se i me i</span></p><p begin="01:00.124" end="01:02.595" itunes:key="L20">僕らはずっと顔の無い亡霊<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一直都是面容模糊的亡灵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ha zu 't to ka o no na i bo u re i</span></p><p begin="01:02.596" end="01:05.846" itunes:key="L21">悔やんで病んで止んでよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让悔恨与烦恼统统到此为止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ya n de ya n de ya n de yo</span></p><p begin="01:05.847" end="01:10.614" itunes:key="L22">夕間暮れ もう離れ離れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夕阳西下 我们已天各一方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u ma gu re mo u ha na re ba na re</span></p><p begin="01:10.615" end="01:13.790" itunes:key="L23">かげふみしながら神隠しを待ってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一边踩踏着影子而行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ge fu mi shi na ga ra</span></p><p begin="01:13.791" end="01:16.745" itunes:key="L24">繋いだ手と手<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你手牵着手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na i da te to te</span></p><p begin="01:16.746" end="01:21.386" itunes:key="L25">気まぐれ躁鬱 笑えば泣け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因阴晴不定的躁郁 笑后却又哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ma gu re so u u tsu wa ra e ba na ke</span></p><p begin="01:21.387" end="01:24.453" itunes:key="L26">ねぇ 明日はきっとまた晴れるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 明天一定还是个晴天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne a shi ta ha ki 't to ma ta ha re ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:24.454" end="01:27.302" itunes:key="L27">吊るした法師がべぇ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吊起的晴天娃娃露出鬼脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ru shi ta ho u shi ga be</span></p><p begin="01:27.303" end="01:29.971" itunes:key="L28">光るから抱く憧れも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因向往光芒而怀揣的憧憬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ru ka ra da ku a ko ga re mo</span></p><p begin="01:29.972" end="01:32.721" itunes:key="L29">傷む バカ味覚で味わうの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也会惹人心伤 以迟钝的味觉去品味</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta mu ba ka mi ka ku de a ji wa u no</span></p><p begin="01:32.722" end="01:35.364" itunes:key="L30">白む空に ピアスとサテライト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泛白的天空 卫星闪烁如耳环点缀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ra mu ku u ni pi a su to sa te ra i to</span></p><p begin="01:35.365" end="01:38.214" itunes:key="L31">忘れないよ 始発の嘘 嘘<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会忘却 最初的那个谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re na i yo shi ha tsu no u so u so</span></p><p begin="01:38.215" end="01:40.813" itunes:key="L32">またね うわずった声が響く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见 有些变调的声音响起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta ne u wa zu 't ta ko e ga hi bi ku</span></p><p begin="01:40.814" end="01:43.438" itunes:key="L33">「笑え」なんて言った 君が滲む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对我说“笑一笑吧”的你朦胧于视线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 wa ra e 」 na n te i 't ta ki mi ga ni ji mu</span></p><p begin="01:43.439" end="01:46.297" itunes:key="L34">たらればと揺れるブラウス<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是如此就让衬衫恣意翻飞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ra re ba to yu re ru bu ra u su</span></p><p begin="01:46.298" end="01:48.620" itunes:key="L35">消えないの君はミーム<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挥之不去的你好似模因</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e na i no ki mi ha mi i mu</span></p><p begin="01:48.621" end="01:51.141" itunes:key="L36">また雨 晴れるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至再次历经雨转晴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a me ha re ru ma de</span></p><p begin="01:51.142" end="01:53.789" itunes:key="L37">垂らす翅 枯れる風<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任翅膀垂落 微风干涩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ra su ha ne ka re ru ka ze</span></p><p begin="01:53.790" end="01:56.638" itunes:key="L38">まるで枷 もうこれじゃダメ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同枷锁桎梏 难以坚持下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ru de ka se mo u ko re ja da me</span></p><p begin="01:56.639" end="01:59.364" itunes:key="L39">ずぶ濡れで晴れを待って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浑身湿透 静待天晴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu bu nu re de ha re wo ma 't te</span></p><p begin="01:59.365" end="02:02.903" itunes:key="L40">それでも君にはなれなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此我也无法成为你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo ki mi ni ha na re na ku te</span></p><p begin="02:02.904" end="02:05.649" itunes:key="L41">僕は僕のままで生きてくどうせ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反正我只能活出我自己而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha bo ku no ma ma de i ki te ku do u se</span></p><p begin="02:05.650" end="02:07.838" itunes:key="L42">浮かぶ輪に駆けた思い出<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回忆驰骋于重现的轮回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ka bu wa ni ka ke ta o mo i de</span></p><p begin="02:07.839" end="02:11.205" itunes:key="L43">痛てぇ なんでなんでなんでよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好痛 为何为何为何会如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu u te na n de na n de na n de yo</span></p><p begin="02:11.206" end="02:15.935" itunes:key="L44">夕間暮れ もう別れた影<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夕阳西下 仅剩离别的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u ma gu re mo u wa ka re ta ka ge</span></p><p begin="02:15.936" end="02:17.388" itunes:key="L45">世界の終わりを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都在等待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i no o wa ri wo</span></p><p begin="02:17.389" end="02:19.220" itunes:key="L46">ずっとずっと待ってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界迎来终焉的那一刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to zu 't to ma 't te ta</span></p><p begin="02:19.221" end="02:22.221" itunes:key="L47">君とならなんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能与你在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to na ra na n te</span></p><p begin="02:22.222" end="02:26.869" itunes:key="L48">気休めを結う いつかは誰？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些慰藉的话语终会由谁诉说？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ya su me wo yu u i tsu ka ha da re ？</span></p><p begin="02:26.870" end="02:30.200" itunes:key="L49">ねえ 明日もきっと灰色の空<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 明天天空定是一片阴翳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e a shi ta mo ki 't to ha i i ro no so ra</span></p><p begin="02:30.201" end="02:32.668" itunes:key="L50">流れた星のせい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都要归咎于流星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ga re ta ho shi no se i</span></p><p begin="02:32.669" end="02:33.478" itunes:key="L51">フラッシュバック<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回忆闪现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ra 's shu ba 'k ku</span></p><p begin="02:33.479" end="02:35.670" itunes:key="L52">また死んで輪廻転生<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次历经生死轮回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta shi n de ri n ne te n se i</span></p><p begin="02:35.671" end="02:38.412" itunes:key="L53">繰り返してすり減らした生命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日复一日消磨着生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e shi te su ri he ra shi ta se i me i</span></p><p begin="02:38.413" end="02:40.968" itunes:key="L54">僕らはずっと顔の無い亡霊<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一直都是面容模糊的亡灵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ha zu 't to ka o no na i bo u re i</span></p><p begin="02:40.969" end="02:43.533" itunes:key="L55">悔やんで病んで止んでよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让悔恨与烦恼统统到此为止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ya n de ya n de ya n de yo</span></p><p begin="02:43.534" end="02:46.103" itunes:key="L56">嘘みたいな愛に淡い期待<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对虚假的爱仍怀揣淡淡期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u so mi ta i na a i ni a wa i ki ta i</span></p><p begin="02:46.104" end="02:47.807" itunes:key="L57">愚にもつかないな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感受着这种愚昧至极的痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gu ni mo tsu ka na i na i ta i i ta i</span></p><p begin="02:47.808" end="02:49.061" itunes:key="L58">痛い痛い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好痛好痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gu ni mo tsu ka na i na i ta i i ta i</span></p><p begin="02:49.062" end="02:50.194" itunes:key="L59">音の無い世界<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无声静谧的世界已不再有你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to no na i se ka i ki mi ha i na i i na i no</span></p><p begin="02:50.195" end="02:52.322" itunes:key="L60">君はいない いないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已经不在了 不在了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to no na i se ka i ki mi ha i na i i na i no</span></p><p begin="02:52.323" end="02:54.992" itunes:key="L61">いらないの いらないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无必要 一切都不必要了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ra na i no i ra na i no</span></p><p begin="02:54.993" end="02:59.631" itunes:key="L62">夕間暮れもう離れ離れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夕阳西下 我们已天各一方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u ma gu re mo u ha na re ba na re</span></p><p begin="03:05.456" end="03:10.618" itunes:key="L63">気まぐれ躁鬱笑えば泣け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因阴晴不定的躁郁 笑后却又哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ma gu re so u u tsu wa ra e ba na ke</span></p><p begin="03:16.584" end="03:21.255" itunes:key="L64">夕間暮れ もう離れ離れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夕阳西下 我们已天各一方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u ma gu re mo u ha na re ba na re</span></p><p begin="03:21.256" end="03:24.634" itunes:key="L65">かげふみしながら神隠しを待ってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一边踩踏着影子而行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ge fu mi shi na ga ra</span></p><p begin="03:24.635" end="03:27.568" itunes:key="L66">繋いだ手と手<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你手牵着手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na i da te to te</span></p><p begin="03:27.569" end="03:32.428" itunes:key="L67">気まぐれ躁鬱 笑えば泣け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因阴晴不定的躁郁 笑后却又哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ma gu re so u u tsu wa ra e ba na ke</span></p><p begin="03:32.429" end="03:35.527" itunes:key="L68">ねぇ 明日はきっとまた晴れるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 明天一定还是个晴天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne a shi ta ha ki 't to ma ta ha re ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:35.528" end="03:53.862" itunes:key="L69">吊るした法師がべぇ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吊起的晴天娃娃露出鬼脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ru shi ta ho u shi ga be</span></p></div></body></tt>